         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### ¡Pensemos!\n\nTodos los puntos de la tabla del cero están sobre la misma línea horizontal—en el valor cero.\nSi unimos los puntos vecinos con trazos rectos, ¿nuestro dibujo será una **línea recta y plana**?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "53a6fc0f-5cfa-464e-9e91-4697760e77de",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "53a6fc0f-5cfa-464e-9e91-4697760e77de",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "b77ec8fc-c988-45f3-82f8-03b136bf1aa9",
               "text": "Chart JS",
               "page": "https://www.chartjs.org/",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2025",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "a648cecf-238e-4294-a012-3830ff833d67",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=a648cecf-238e-4294-a012-3830ff833d67",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### ¡Sí! Una Línea Recta y Plana\n\n¡Exacto! Cuando unimos todos los puntos con trazos rectos, nuestro dibujo se convierte en una **línea recta** completamente **plana**—como todo resultado es cero, la línea nunca sube ni baja: queda exactamente sobre la línea horizontal:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 190\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:500px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"190\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><defs><marker id=\"arrowH\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"#333333\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"32\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowH)\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-ancho